 * door_lock.c — Raspberry Pi 5 (64-bit Bookworm) door-lock controller.
 *
 * Hardware:
 *   - ADS1115 ADC on /dev/i2c-1, address 0x48, A0 tied to GP2Y0A21YK0F VOUT.
 *   - Relay module on GPIO17 (active-high).
 *   - Magnetic reed door sensor on GPIO27 (active-low, pull-up).
 *
 * Build:
 *   gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o door_lock door_lock.c
