 * Hardware:
 *   - MPR121 capacitive touch sensor on /dev/i2c-1 (I2C bus 1, GPIO2=SDA, GPIO3=SCL)
 *   - 4-bit LED pattern on GPIO17, GPIO18, GPIO27, GPIO22 (BCM numbering)
 *
