 *   Polls the MPR121 touch status register every 50 ms.  When any electrode
 *   detects proximity, drives the 4-bit LED pattern and logs the event to
 *   stdout with a timestamp.  Handles I2C bus errors, sensor-absent detection,
 *   and clean resource release on SIGINT/SIGTERM.
