/*
 * FXOS8700 I2C reader for Raspberry Pi 4 Model B
 *
 * Wiring (BCM numbering):
 *   SDA  -> GPIO2 (Pin 3)
 *   SCL  -> GPIO3 (Pin 5)
 *   VDD  -> 3.3 V
 *   GND  -> GND
